  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abraham journeyed from thence toward the south country, and dwelled between Kadesh and Shur, and sojourned in Gerar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abraham said of Sarah his wife, She",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my sister: and Abimelech king of Gerar sent, and took Sarah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But God came to Abimelech in a dream by night, and said to him, Behold, thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a dead man, for the woman which thou hast taken; for she",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a man's wife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Abimelech had not come near her: and he said, Lord, wilt thou slay also a righteous nation?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Said he not unto me, She",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my sister? and she, even she herself said, He",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my brother: in the integrity of my heart and innocency of my hands have I done this.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And God said unto him in a dream, Yea, I know that thou didst this in the integrity of thy heart; for I also withheld thee from sinning against me: therefore suffered I thee not to touch her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now therefore restore the man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wife; for he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a prophet, and he shall pray for thee, and thou shalt live: and if thou restore",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "her",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not, know thou that thou shalt surely die, thou, and all that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore Abimelech rose early in the morning, and called all his servants, and told all these things in their ears: and the men were sore afraid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Abimelech called Abraham, and said unto him, What hast thou done unto us? and what have I offended thee, that thou hast brought on me and on my kingdom a great sin? thou hast done deeds unto me that ought not to be done.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abimelech said unto Abraham, What sawest thou, that thou hast done this thing?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abraham said, Because I thought, Surely the fear of God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not in this place; and they will slay me for my wife's sake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And yet indeed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "she is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my sister; she",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the daughter of my father, but not the daughter of my mother; and she became my wife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, when God caused me to wander from my father's house, that I said unto her, This",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy kindness which thou shalt shew unto me; at every place whither we shall come, say of me, He",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my brother.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abimelech took sheep, and oxen, and menservants, and womenservants, and gave",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto Abraham, and restored him Sarah his wife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abimelech said, Behold, my land",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "before thee: dwell where it pleaseth thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And unto Sarah he said, Behold, I have given thy brother a thousand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "pieces",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of silver: behold, he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to thee a covering of the eyes, unto all that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with thee, and with all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "other:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.20.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.20.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thus she was reproved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
